<GuidePage title="Website Investment Guide New Zealand 2026 | Maximise Your Digital ROI | Byte Digital" description="A comprehensive guide to understanding the value of a professional website investment for New Zealand businesses. Learn what drives value, how to maximise ROI, and what to consider when choosing a web design partner." jsonLd={jsonLd}>

  <section class="section dot-pattern">
    <div class="container">
